Your social security rights in Poland  

41 • assistance for becoming independent and to continue education ( pomoc na usamodzielnienie 
oraz kontynuowanie nauki ); 
• financial benefit to cover the costs of learning Polish for foreigners;  
• Supplementary parental benefit  (rodzicielskie świadczenie uzupełniające, Mothers 4 Plus) . Benefit amounts:  
maximum amount for 
permanent allowance  PLN 1,000 per month  
minimum amount for 
permanent allowance  PLN 30 per month  
minimum amount for 
periodic allowance  PLN 20 per month  
supplementary parental 
benefit  equal to the lowest old -age pension (PLN  1,780.96 as of 1 March 2024)  
In case of parents who are already entitled to a pension below the lowest old -age 
pension, this benefit supplements the pension in order to reach the amount of the 
lowest old -age pension. Social assistance also offers benefits in kind such as:  
• credited tickets;  
• contributions for health and welfare insurance;  
• payment for a funeral;  
• specialist advice;  
• social work;  
• shelter, food and necessary clothing in hardship cases;  
• care services;  
• board and service in a social assistance home. Supplementary parental benefit is granted to the following:  
• the mother who either gave birth to or raised at least four children;  
